# `WangZahlLot.wz_multiscale_c2_extraction`

Sticky Lemmas 5.4–5.5, Corollary 5.6 and Proposition 5.7 from Lemma 5.3.

* `Slab.localGridLinearity_of_slab`: from the slab lemma (`hlin`) and the absence of examples
  above `σ`, independent affine fits of the slope on the height cells of every interior scale
